          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Start with a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "magic-ring-a174"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "magic ring"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Round 1: 6 dc. Round 2: 2 dc in each (12 sts). Round 3: (dc, 2 dc in next) x 6 (18 sts). Round 4: dc around. Round 5: (dc, "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "dc2tog-a174"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "dc2tog"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ") x 6 (12 sts). Round 6: dc2tog x 6 (6 sts). Leave open. Lightly stuff. Do not close."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Centre disc"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Magic ring, 6 dc. Round 2: 2 dc in each (12 sts). Round 3: (dc, 2 dc in next) x 6 (18 sts). Chain 1, do not join."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Assembly"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Space the five points evenly around the centre disc. Use a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "slip-stitch-join-a174"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "slip stitch join"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " to attach the open base of each point to the edge of the disc, working one per section. Thread the sewing tail through the remaining 6 sts at each tip and pull tight. Weave in all ends. Attach a keychain clip to one point tip."
          }
        ]
      }
